-- Clean-room implementation written for FFXIPort Milestone 8 from
-- docs/PROTOCOL-FPX1.md and the public LandSandBoat source (branch "base").
-- It is not derived from any earlier FFXIPort server module or from
-- Driftwood/dwport. See docs/PROVENANCE-M8.md.
--
-- The city-group table (M.cityGroupOfZone) is generated by
-- tools/gen_city_groups.lua from LandSandBoat homepoint.lua groups,
-- src/map/utils/zoneutils.cpp (GetCurrentRegion) and data/zones/*/zone.yaml
-- (type: city).
--
-- The home-point destination table below reproduces factual data
-- (coordinates, groups, fee multipliers; the fee multiplier is kept as LSB
-- data but is not used for pricing since RC3) from LandSandBoat
-- scripts/globals/homepoint.lua (GPL-3.0-or-later, (c) LandSandBoat / Darkstar
-- Dev Teams), because LSB keeps that table file-local. Survival-guide, gate
-- crystal and runic-portal data are read from LSB's own tables at runtime.
--
-- Player command:  !fpx <ver> <rid> <op> [args]   (see docs/PROTOCOL-FPX1.md)
-- No Phoenix/LSB core file is modified.
-----------------------------------
